  "claim_scope": "Existing source-generated actual_segment retains its exact native packet, paid offsets and full actual node witnesses. The settled native frame supplies the already-generated sigma/full trace/sameborn inventory and actual born update. Original bornMaterial effect, residual inverse and affine write are read in actual born.activeEnvironment; its computed source constant binding generates the existing substitution complexMorphism. Dependent Sigma enrichment preserves the entire original segment. Same-r source-receipt cofinal action span remains directly consumed; no new Stage/controller/runtime or completed future table.",
