    "Source and Consumer freshly pass focused trust0/werror in the independent clean library; both production OLeans are byte-identical to frozen exports.",
    "All 17 exact original new controls and 17 printed mouths pass. Lean confirms controls10/12/13/14/17 are non-Prop definitions, the remaining12 are theorems, and control17 preserves arbitrary Result : Sort v.",
    "Existing original CP106AdmissionStops and CP110InquiryDiagram gates freshly pass; paid-not-settled, scalar erasure/distinct occurrences and full-field nonzero controls remain intact.",
    "Original source-generated actual_segment is enriched by a dependent Sigma payload at its own original native packet. Erasure is exactly the original Sum, preserving distance-zero and full native branches, all paid offsets and actual node witnesses.",
    "Actual receipt selects its own settled native frame at Lower W grade. The source-generated bornMaterial updated input equals born.activeEnvironment, and original effect, residual, affine write and generated rangeEquiv coordinate are consumed there.",
    "Actual born Env constants generate the existing SourceSubstitution.complexMorphism. Full-State CP110 cofinal source span remains the original direct readout, with no identification of its Carrier and the local born Env fibre.",
    "The independent Sum.elim consumer actually consumes generated cofinalSegment, with separate distance-zero and full dependent native handlers. It grants no terminal or arbitrary physical projection.",
    "All 37 new production declarations plus17 controls have complete type/value constant provenance:13194 logical declarations,83 explicit target paths, authorized axioms only, no unsafe/partial/unresolved declarations.",
    "1379 nonowned source snapshots match tracked HEAD with zero delta. All reused OLeans/sidecars come from signature-matched formally certified CP110/CP107 evidence; no construction artifacts are reused as new kernel evidence."
  ],
