  "scope_limits": {
    "input_mouth": "cofinalSegment takes only type/group parameters and actual factory, initial, cfg, language, ordinal. No caller-selected native frame, completed future table, target commutes, positivity, terminal, coverage or disposition enters this producer.",
    "actual_segment": "realizedSegment enriches original Admissions.actual_segment with a dependent Sigma payload. Original distance-zero Sum branch and full native packet, paid offsets and actual node witnesses are retained. realizedSegment_source proves exact erasure equality for every start.",
    "native_selection": "selected is the localNativeReceipt stopping frame of the original AdmissionPacket at its own Lower W native.1 grade; selected_settled consumes that receipt's own settlement/action witnesses.",
    "born_environment": "born is original Shared.nextBorn(selected,stockCfg(native.cfg)). native input Env, prebirth registered Env and decoded born active Env retain their distinct source indices. actual_born_updated_environment identifies the original updated residual input with that born.activeEnvironment; effect/residual/affine write are evaluated there.",
    "literal_boundary": "actual_born_boundary remains the literal single registered expression minus single event residual expression. The affine write is boundary minus constantMap(valueMap born.activeEnvironment boundary); historical relation membership does not yield born Env zero.",
    "inverse": "actual_born_inverse consumes original effectFaces.rangeEquiv at the generated paidCoordinate and identifies its value with the actual expression at born.activeEnvironment. The full inverse construction remains the already-paid original source, rather than an injected witness.",
    "local_arrow": "bornBinding uses actual born activeEnvironment constants. Original SourceSubstitution.complexMorphism produces the backward complex arrow from born.activeEnvironment to born.registered.input.environment; neither binding nor commuting proofs are caller arguments.",
    "dependent_fibres": "Local born Env complexes use actual Lower W grade. Full-State CP110 cofinalDiagram/source_span keep their independent Carrier. This candidate preserves both source-indexed fibres and does not prove their identity or an arbitrary physical projection arrow.",
    "independent_consumer": "consumeCofinalSegment is original Sum.elim on generated cofinalSegment, with separate distance-zero and full dependent native handlers, Result : Sort v. The handlers are readout consumers and do not produce or certify a terminal.",
    "authority": "No new Stage, root, controller, runtime or U7/U8 is introduced. This is a subordinate source/effect producer and same-r cofinal consumer of existing actual events; no controller advancement or global terminal is claimed.",
    "suggestions_index": "Existing Lean.LibrarySuggestions.nameDenyListExt only excludes the generated namespace from suggestion retrieval/indexing. All new declarations still undergo focused kernel checking at trust0; no kernel escape or proof-body replacement was used."
  },
